('127.621.d.1.A',4,'Why does cosmetology require study of the body''s systems?','["it reduces the need for tools", "it replaces licensing", "it avoids client contact", "services directly affect skin, hair and nails"]'::jsonb,3,'Understanding the body prevents harm.','original'),
('127.621.d.1.B',3,'The part of the hair that is visible above the scalp is the:','["hair shaft", "hair root", "papilla", "follicle"]'::jsonb,0,'The shaft is the visible part.','original'),
