('127.621.d.1.H',3,'A written plan for cleaning, disinfecting and handling blood exposure is an infection:','["control plan", "sale flyer", "fashion line", "menu"]'::jsonb,0,'Plans keep everyone safe.','original'),
('127.621.d.1.H',4,'Which belongs in a salon infection control plan?','["music playlists", "cleaning schedules and disposal steps", "client gossip", "coupon codes"]'::jsonb,1,'Plans list procedures and responsibilities.','original'),
('127.621.d.2.A',3,'Applying health and safety policies means doing what the posted rules say:','["never", "sometimes", "every day", "rarely"]'::jsonb,2,'Consistency protects clients.','original'),
('127.621.d.2.A',4,'A stylist who skips hand washing between clients is failing to apply:','["fashion trends", "music licensing", "pricing rules", "health and safety procedures"]'::jsonb,3,'Hygiene prevents cross-contamination.','original'),
('127.621.d.2.B',3,'Under TDLR rules, a spill of chemicals on the floor is a potentially:','["hazardous situation", "decorative item", "quiet moment", "profitable situation"]'::jsonb,0,'Recognizing hazards prevents injury.','original'),
('127.621.d.2.B',4,'A stylist who notices an exposed outlet near the shampoo bowl should:','["cover it with a towel", "report it and keep clients away", "ignore it", "use it anyway"]'::jsonb,1,'Water and electric hazards must be fixed.','original'),
('127.621.d.2.C',3,'To see exam eligibility and logged student hours, go to the:','["school gym", "bus stop", "TDLR website", "lost-and-found"]'::jsonb,2,'TDLR tracks that information.','original'),
('127.621.d.2.C',4,'Which information can a student find on the TDLR site?','["game scores", "lunch recipes", "coupon deals", "exam results"]'::jsonb,3,'Results and hours are posted there.','original'),
