('127.621.d.3.A',3,'Using shears with their blades closed when not in use and storing them safely shows:','["poor posture", "wasted time", "safe tool use", "slow service"]'::jsonb,2,'Careful handling prevents cuts.','original'),
('127.621.d.3.A',4,'Selecting the right tool for each service is part of employing tools:','["carelessly", "randomly", "expensively", "safely and effectively"]'::jsonb,3,'Right tool, right job.','original'),
('127.621.d.3.B',3,'A tilting, height-adjustable stool is an example of:','["ergonomic equipment", "a clutter source", "a hazard", "a risk"]'::jsonb,0,'It reduces strain.','original'),
