('127.621.d.3.C',4,'A good use of salon technology is to:','["delay clients", "distract staff", "lose records", "track appointments and sales"]'::jsonb,3,'Technology streamlines operations.','original'),
('127.621.d.3.D',3,'Used razors, chemical waste and nonhazardous trash must be separated, which applies universal:','["precautions", "patterns", "prices", "styles"]'::jsonb,0,'Different waste has different handling rules.','original'),
('127.621.d.3.D',4,'A stylist disposes of used hair color in the regular trash. This violates:','["dress code", "hazardous waste rules", "scheduling policy", "parking rules"]'::jsonb,1,'Chemicals need proper disposal.','original'),
