('127.665.d.7.C',4,'Failing to follow regulations can lead to:','["free time", "fines or loss of license", "new clients", "bonuses"]'::jsonb,1,'Noncompliance has penalties.','original'),
('127.665.d.8.A',3,'Using accounting software to track deposits and expenses is managing funds with:','["luck", "memory only", "technology", "guesses"]'::jsonb,2,'Software improves accuracy.','original'),
('127.665.d.8.A',4,'A worker uses a spreadsheet to monitor a program''s budget. This is a use of technology to:','["avoid records", "hide costs", "lose money", "manage funds"]'::jsonb,3,'Tracking funds ensures accountability.','original'),
('127.665.d.8.B',3,'Ordering supplies at the best price and tracking receipts follows sound:','["business practices", "gaming rules", "party plans", "art lessons"]'::jsonb,0,'Good practices save money.','original'),
('127.665.d.8.B',4,'Before ordering supplies, a worker should compare:','["weather", "prices and quality", "mascots", "hobbies"]'::jsonb,1,'Smart buying controls costs.','original'),
('127.665.d.8.C',3,'A client asks what services are offered. The best response is to:','["ignore the question", "guess", "answer clearly and accurately", "change the subject"]'::jsonb,2,'Accurate answers build trust.','original'),
('127.665.d.8.C',4,'If you do not know an answer to a client''s question, you should:','["make up an answer", "tell them to leave", "ignore them", "find out or refer to someone who knows"]'::jsonb,3,'Honesty is key.','original'),
('127.665.d.8.D',3,'Giving clients correct, relevant information is advising clients with:','["appropriate information", "rumors", "opinions only", "guesses"]'::jsonb,0,'Advice must be accurate.','original'),
('127.665.d.8.D',4,'A good adviser considers the client''s needs, resources and:','["pet", "goals", "hairstyle", "mood of the day"]'::jsonb,1,'Advice should fit the client''s situation.','original'),
('127.666.d.2.',3,'A worker uses a structured method to find the cause of a repeated scheduling error in a program. This is an example of:','["avoidance", "delay", "advanced problem solving", "guesswork"]'::jsonb,2,'Problem solving uses a process.','original'),
('127.666.d.2.',4,'The first step in a structured problem-solving method is to:','["assign blame", "wait for it to disappear", "pick a random fix", "clearly define the problem"]'::jsonb,3,'You must know the problem before solving it.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.A',3,'A worker speaks clearly and uses positive body language with a client. This demonstrates:','["verbal and non-verbal communication", "silence", "avoidance", "isolation"]'::jsonb,0,'Both channels support understanding.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.A',4,'Which response best fits clear, concise communication with a client?','["a mumbled reply", "a short, plain explanation of the next step", "jargon the client cannot follow", "a long, rambling story"]'::jsonb,1,'Be clear and brief.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.B',3,'Explaining a program to a board meeting is a _____ presentation.','["casual", "secret", "formal", "silent"]'::jsonb,2,'Boards expect formal delivery.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.B',4,'A quick chat updating a coworker on a client''s status is an example of an _____ presentation of information.','["formal", "legal", "written only", "informal"]'::jsonb,3,'Informal talks share quick updates.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.C',3,'Reading a report, understanding its meaning and explaining it to clients is analyzing and:','["interpreting information", "hiding information", "altering information", "ignoring information"]'::jsonb,0,'Interpretation turns data into understanding.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.C',4,'A worker summarizes survey results in plain language for volunteers. This helps volunteers:','["guess the results", "understand the findings", "avoid the topic", "stop volunteering"]'::jsonb,1,'Plain language helps.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.D',3,'Paying full attention, nodding and asking follow-up questions are examples of:','["interrupting", "daydreaming", "active listening", "multitasking"]'::jsonb,2,'Active listening clarifies information.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.D',4,'To make sure you understood a client''s request, you can:','["change the subject", "assume you understood", "walk away", "restate it in your own words"]'::jsonb,3,'Paraphrasing checks meaning.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.E',3,'Positive interactions with both clients and the public help maintain good:','["public relations", "gossip", "delays", "conflict"]'::jsonb,0,'PR protects an organization''s image.','original'),
('127.666.d.1.E',4,'An agency thanks donors with a personal note. This builds good relations with its:','["competitors", "external customers", "landlords", "vendors only"]'::jsonb,1,'Donors are part of the public.','original'),
('127.666.d.3.A',3,'Posted rules about lifting, chemicals and exits are workplace:','["vacation plans", "menu items", "safety rules", "dress themes"]'::jsonb,2,'Following them prevents injuries.','original'),
('127.666.d.3.A',4,'A worker consistently follows safety rules even when no one is watching. This shows:','["fear", "neglect", "luck", "responsibility"]'::jsonb,3,'Consistent safety shows maturity.','original'),
('127.666.d.3.B',3,'An accessible, well-lit building near public transportation is a good place to:','["safely offer human services", "avoid clients", "limit access", "hide services"]'::jsonb,0,'Location affects safety and access.','original'),
('127.666.d.3.B',4,'When choosing a location for a food pantry, staff should consider safety and:','["decoration cost only", "accessibility for clients", "distance from clients", "hidden entrances"]'::jsonb,1,'Clients must be able to reach it.','original'),
('127.666.d.3.C',3,'Knowing CPR, first aid or how to call 911 is part of providing:','["bookkeeping", "filing", "emergency aid", "advertising"]'::jsonb,2,'Quick response matters.','original'),
('127.666.d.3.C',4,'A volunteer collapses in the break room. A trained coworker should:','["wait", "leave", "film it", "check responsiveness and call for help"]'::jsonb,3,'Immediate action helps.','original'),
('127.666.d.3.D',3,'Knowing where exits are and what to do during a tornado shows understanding of a disaster and emergency:','["response plan", "menu", "fashion", "price list"]'::jsonb,0,'Plans guide safe action.','original'),
('127.666.d.3.D',4,'During an emergency drill, staff guide clients to:','["the parking lot only", "designated exits and safe areas", "their cars", "the break room"]'::jsonb,1,'Plans identify safe routes.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.A',3,'Arriving on time, finishing assigned tasks and staying positive shows a good:','["loan", "excuse", "work ethic", "rumor"]'::jsonb,2,'Work ethic is valued by employers.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.A',4,'A worker who completes tasks as directed even when they are routine shows:','["laziness", "indifference", "rebellion", "productive work ethic"]'::jsonb,3,'Reliable work builds trust.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.B',3,'Keeping client information private and following the law are ethical and _____ responsibilities.','["legal", "recreational", "financial", "optional"]'::jsonb,0,'Ethics and law guide conduct.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.B',4,'A human services worker who shares a client''s story to get attention violates:','["office decor", "ethical and legal duties", "dress code", "break policy"]'::jsonb,1,'Confidentiality is required.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.C',3,'Choosing the honest option even when it is harder shows:','["speed", "luck", "integrity", "arrogance"]'::jsonb,2,'Integrity means doing right.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.C',4,'A worker finds extra cash in a donation box that doesn''t match records. The ethical choice is to:','["spend it", "keep it", "hide it", "report it and correct the records"]'::jsonb,3,'Integrity protects trust.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.D',3,'A staff member helps a client get benefits the client is entitled to. This is:','["client advocacy", "client neglect", "client gossip", "client blame"]'::jsonb,0,'Advocacy supports rights.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.D',4,'Appropriate advocacy means speaking up through:','["social media rants", "proper procedures", "secret deals", "threats"]'::jsonb,1,'Use the right channels.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.E',3,'Following all laws and rules consistently is being:','["careless", "flexible", "compliant", "hesitant"]'::jsonb,2,'Compliance protects clients and workers.','original'),
('127.666.d.4.E',4,'A worker who knows a rule but skips it ''just this once'' is not acting in:','["high spirit", "good humor", "fast time", "consistent compliance"]'::jsonb,3,'Rules apply every time.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.A',3,'A supervised practicum requires students to plan, document and evaluate their:','["learning activities", "sports", "hobbies", "vacations"]'::jsonb,0,'Documentation shows learning.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.A',4,'After completing a supervised practicum task, the student evaluates what worked so they can:','["skip reflection", "improve next time", "repeat errors", "hide results"]'::jsonb,1,'Evaluation drives growth.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.B',3,'A set of checks confirming that services meet set standards is a quality-control:','["menu", "game", "system", "trend"]'::jsonb,2,'Quality control ensures standards.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.B',4,'Regular audits of service logs are an example of:','["decoration", "delay", "gossip", "quality-control practice"]'::jsonb,3,'Audits find problems early.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.C',3,'Desks, phones and electricity needed for a counseling office are part of a functional:','["work environment", "game", "costume", "menu"]'::jsonb,0,'Environment must support the work.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.C',4,'Before opening a new office, staff list equipment needs and required:','["slogans", "utilities", "parties", "uniform colors"]'::jsonb,1,'Power, water and internet are required.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.D',3,'Courtesy, patience and cultural awareness help staff work with a diverse:','["tool", "shelf", "population", "machine"]'::jsonb,2,'Clients come from many backgrounds.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.D',4,'Greeting each client by name and listening without judgment demonstrates:','["bias", "impatience", "indifference", "appropriate social skills"]'::jsonb,3,'Respect builds trust.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.E',3,'Photos of programs, signed evaluations and letters of recommendation are examples of representative:','["work samples", "bills", "receipts", "games"]'::jsonb,0,'Samples show your skill.','original'),
('127.666.d.5.E',4,'Collecting work samples during a practicum helps a student later in a:','["lost files", "portfolio or job application", "vacation", "party"]'::jsonb,1,'Samples support hiring.','original')
) as v(code, diff, prompt, choices, ans, expl, src)
join public.teks_items i on i.code = v.code and i.is_standard
join public.teks_documents d on d.id = i.document_id and d.subject = 'Career Development' and d.language = 'en'
on conflict (fingerprint) do nothing;
